{"seq":2,"slug":"diversity-spend-attribution-tier2","title":"多元化支出归因与二级（tier-2）传导计量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/diversity-spend-program/diversity-spend-attribution-tier2","wordCount":2776,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"多元化支出归因与二级-tier-2-传导计量\">多元化支出归因与二级（tier-2）传导计量</h1><p>一家跨境电商企业自己的采购额是&quot;一级支出&quot;（tier-1 spend）：PO 开给谁就算谁的支出，好数、好审、好报。真正难的是<strong>二级支出</strong>（tier-2 spend）——你的直接供应商（prime）拿这笔钱转手又付给了谁。这部分钱没进过你的 ERP，而监管方、平台审核与客户记分卡越来越要求你把它算出来。本文解决：<strong>归因边界怎么划、金额怎么加减、证书怎么回验、指标怎么算、哪些做法会被判为作弊</strong>。上一节 <a href=\"diverse-supplier-certification-classification\">多元供应商认定与分类</a> 讲&quot;这家供应商是不是多元供应商&quot;，本节讲&quot;钱怎么沿着供应链往下走两层&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一级与二级的归因边界\">核心概念：一级与二级的归因边界</h2><p>归因的第一步不是算数，而是<strong>确定自己站在哪一层</strong>。同一笔钱在不同口径里有不同归属，判错层就会重复计数。三个术语必须先分清：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一级供应商（Tier 1 supplier）</strong>：&quot;直接向采购方出售的供应商，也称直接供应商或主供应商&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.supplierdiversity.com/guides/glossary/\">supplierdiversity.com glossary</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>二级供应商（Tier 2 supplier）</strong>：&quot;向一级供应商提供货物或服务、而非直接向最终买方供货的供应商&quot;（同上）。</li>\n<li><strong>多元化支出（diverse spend）</strong>：&quot;从已认证多元供应商处采购的美元总额&quot;（同上）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键约束来自联邦采购规则：<strong>只有对紧邻下一层（immediate next-tier）分包商的授标才计入本主体的目标</strong>，更下游的授标只有在美国原住民公司（ANC）或印第安部落正式指定该承包商代收时才可计入（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/48/52.219-9\">FAR 52.219-9</a>）。工程含义：<strong>归因图只向外扩展一层</strong>，三级供应商的支出不能算进自己的 tier-2 报表。数据模型因此必须为每条记录显式存储 <code>reporting_tier</code>（相对谁）与 <code>edge_depth</code>（边深度），而不是只存一个供应商 ID。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  B[&quot;采购方 Buyer&lt;br/&gt;ERP: PO / Invoice&quot;] --&gt;|直接授标| T1[&quot;一级供应商 Prime&lt;br/&gt;tier-1 spend 账面可见&quot;]&#10;  T1 --&gt;|分包 / 转付| T2[&quot;二级供应商&lt;br/&gt;tier-2 spend 账面不可见&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt;|再分包| T3[&quot;三级供应商&lt;br/&gt;一般不计入 tier-2 报表&quot;]&#10;  T1 -.-&gt;|&quot;自报金额 + 供应商清单&quot;| HUB[&quot;归因中台&lt;br/&gt;normalize / match / rollup&quot;]&#10;  T2 -.-&gt;|&quot;证书 + 税号&quot;| CERT[&quot;认定数据库&lt;br/&gt;NMSDC / WBENC / SBA&quot;]&#10;  HUB --&gt; CERT&#10;  CERT --&gt;|&quot;valid / expired / unmatched&quot;| HUB\">graph TD\n  B[\"采购方 Buyer&lt;br/&gt;ERP: PO / Invoice\"] --&gt;|直接授标| T1[\"一级供应商 Prime&lt;br/&gt;tier-1 spend 账面可见\"]\n  T1 --&gt;|分包 / 转付| T2[\"二级供应商&lt;br/&gt;tier-2 spend 账面不可见\"]\n  T2 --&gt;|再分包| T3[\"三级供应商&lt;br/&gt;一般不计入 tier-2 报表\"]\n  T1 -.-&gt;|\"自报金额 + 供应商清单\"| HUB[\"归因中台&lt;br/&gt;normalize / match / rollup\"]\n  T2 -.-&gt;|\"证书 + 税号\"| CERT[\"认定数据库&lt;br/&gt;NMSDC / WBENC / SBA\"]\n  HUB --&gt; CERT\n  CERT --&gt;|\"valid / expired / unmatched\"| HUB</pre><p>图中虚线是自报通道，实线是资金流。全部难点都在这条虚线上：<strong>金额由 prime 自报、证书由第三方签发，两者必须在归因中台完成匹配与校验</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因规则-哪些金额可以计入-哪些必须剔除\">归因规则：哪些金额可以计入，哪些必须剔除</h2><p>不是所有从 prime 转出去的钱都算 tier-2 多元化支出。FAR 52.219-9 给出一份具体的剔除清单，商业采购措辞更宽松，但工程实现通常直接沿用这套口径，因为它可审计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计入 / 剔除</th>\n<th>金额类别</th>\n<th>规则来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计入</td>\n<td>支撑合同履行的<strong>直接分包</strong></td>\n<td>全部直接分包必须纳入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计入（按比例）</td>\n<td>共同或联合用途的<strong>间接成本</strong></td>\n<td>FAR 19.701 / 52.219-9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剔除</td>\n<td>向承包商<strong>自身关联方</strong>（affiliate）的采购</td>\n<td>关联方采购不计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剔除（商业计划）</td>\n<td>工资与福利、备用金、折旧、利息、税费、租赁付款、银行手续费、罚款与会费、预谈判质保期 OEM 工、市政专供公用事业费、慈善捐赠</td>\n<td>商业分包计划间接成本排除项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剔除</td>\n<td><strong>雇主—雇员关系</strong>协议（不算分包）</td>\n<td>分包定义排除项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件计入</td>\n<td>属地：一般仅美国境内及外围地区履行的工作计入；国务院合同或法定授权机构例外</td>\n<td>属地限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>属地规则对跨境电商冲击最大：<strong>海外仓、海外代工、海外物流上发生的分包支出，若无法律授权，默认不计入美国体系下的 tier-2 报表</strong>。这也是很多企业维护<strong>两套口径</strong>的原因——一套给联邦 eSRS 报表，一套给商业客户记分卡，后者通常无属地限制但要求更细的供应商级明细。剔除清单落地为过滤器函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>credit</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>subs</mtext></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mtext>amount</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>CUF</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><msub><mtext>affiliate</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>geo</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>indirect</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{credit} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{subs}} \\left( \\text{amount}_i \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{CUF}_i] \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\neg \\text{affiliate}_i] \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{geo}_i] \\right) + \\alpha \\cdot \\text{indirect}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">credit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">subs</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CUF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">affiliate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">geo</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">indirect</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是间接成本可计入比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CUF</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CUF}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CUF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;是否履行了商业上有用的功能&quot;（见下文反作弊一节）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验链路-把二级供应商证书匹配回认定数据库\">校验链路：把二级供应商证书匹配回认定数据库</h2><p>prime 提交二级支出清单时，最容易出错的地方不是金额，而是<strong>这批供应商到底是不是&quot;已认证&quot;多元供应商</strong>。自报的类别没有证据效力；有效做法是把清单里的<strong>税号 / EIN + 公司名</strong>批量回验到认定数据库。</p>\n<p>NMSDC 的 Check-Mate 就是这条链路的原型：成员企业上传一个文本文件，每行&quot;供应商 EIN/税号, 公司名&quot;，NMSDC 拿它跑中心数据库，返回<strong>税号、公司名、认定机构（certifying council）、证书到期日</strong>。会员资格包含前 50,000 次查询，超出部分收取象征性费用，每年最多追加两次检索（<a href=\"https://nmsdc.org/check-mate/\">NMSDC Check-Mate</a>）。返回结果里最有价值的两列是<strong>认定机构</strong>与<strong>到期日</strong>——前者决定证书属于哪套体系，后者决定它此刻是否有效。</p>\n<p>商业平台把同一套逻辑产品化：命名供应商提交后自动匹配到覆盖 20M+ 供应商、450+ 权威来源的数据库，<strong>过期或未匹配的证书会被标记而非静默接受</strong>（<a href=\"https://supplier.io/solutions/tier-2-spend-reporting/\">supplier.io tier-2 spend reporting</a>）。有一条规则必须写死：<strong>按类别上报（&quot;本月向女性企业采购 X 元&quot;）而不指名供应商的记录无法自动核验</strong>，只能走定制化数据补全流程。</p>\n<p>匹配结果是一个三态枚举，直接决定金额是否放行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>valid</code></td>\n<td>命中认定库且证书未过期</td>\n<td>全额计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>expired</code></td>\n<td>命中但证书已过期</td>\n<td>不计入；触发 prime 整改与重认证提醒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unmatched</code></td>\n<td>未命中任何认定库</td>\n<td>挂起；要求补充证书编号或走人工审核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"计量指标与公式\">计量指标与公式</h2><p>只报一个总金额没有意义，因为不同 prime 的采购体量差几个数量级。工程上通常同时维护绝对额与相对率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>二级多元化支出额</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>T2</mtext><mtext>diverse</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mtext>credit</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{T2}_{\\text{diverse}} = \\sum \\text{credit}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T2</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">diverse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">credit</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（仅统计 <code>valid</code> 记录）。</li>\n<li><strong>二级多元化占比</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>T2%</mtext><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mtext>T2</mtext><mtext>diverse</mtext></msub><msub><mtext>T2</mtext><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{T2\\%} = \\dfrac{\\text{T2}_{\\text{diverse}}}{\\text{T2}_{\\text{total}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T2%</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T2</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T2</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">diverse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，分母是该 prime 上报的<strong>全部</strong>二级分包额，含非多元部分。它回答&quot;这家 prime 的转包盘子有多多元&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>传导系数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mtext>T2</mtext><mtext>total</mtext></msub><msub><mtext>T1</mtext><mtext>spend</mtext></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\dfrac{\\text{T2}_{\\text{total}}}{\\text{T1}_{\\text{spend}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spend</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T2</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，衡量一级支出往下传导的比例。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 越高，prime 越偏向转包而非自营。</li>\n<li><strong>参与率</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>prime 已提交</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>prime 被要求提交</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PR} = \\dfrac{\\#\\{\\text{prime 已提交}\\}}{\\#\\{\\text{prime 被要求提交}\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prime </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">被要求提交</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prime </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已提交</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，是唯一能反映<strong>数据完整性</strong>的指标；没有它，低覆盖率的漂亮报表会误导所有读者。优秀水平大致是参与率可达 80%、提交量可达行业均值两倍（<a href=\"https://supplier.io/solutions/tier-2-spend-reporting/\">supplier.io</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>报表合同时必须<strong>对齐会计期间与口径</strong>：prime 的财年可能与你不同，货币、汇率、含税与否都要在入库时统一，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>T2%</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{T2\\%}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T2%</span></span></span></span></span></span> 会在不同期之间无意义地跳动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反作弊-循环上报-过水与类别化上报\">反作弊：循环上报、过水与类别化上报</h2><p>tier-2 归因天然激励造假，因为金额由被考核方自己上报。三类作弊必须从数据模型层面阻断：</p>\n<p><strong>循环上报（circular reporting）。</strong> A 报 B、B 报 A，同一笔钱被数两次。防御手段是<strong>基于税号的有向图去重</strong>：把每条 <code>(reporter_ein, supplier_ein, period)</code> 建成有向边，对成环的边做拓扑剔除，再做跨期一致性校验。</p>\n<p><strong>过水（pass-through）。</strong> 多元供应商只开票不走货，真实工作由背后非多元主体完成。对应概念是<strong>商业上有用的功能（Commercially Useful Function, CUF）</strong>——&quot;要求多元分包商履行真实、实质的工作，而非仅仅过账&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.supplierdiversity.com/guides/glossary/\">supplierdiversity.com glossary</a>）。工程上无法完全自动判定，但可埋<strong>间接信号</strong>：毛利率异常低、同批货物短期内多次转手、员工数与营收严重不匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>类别化上报。</strong> 只报类别不报供应商名，规避证书回验。这是最普遍的一种，且<strong>技术上无法自动验证</strong>（<a href=\"https://supplier.io/solutions/tier-2-spend-reporting/\">supplier.io</a>）。唯一应对是在<strong>合同条款层面</strong>要求指名上报，并把&quot;可核验记录占比&quot;纳入记分卡，使其成为可见、被考核的数量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境场景-谁在要求这份数据\">跨境场景：谁在要求这份数据</h2><p>同一份 tier-2 数据，在不同合规体系下被以不同方式施加要求。工程团队需要知道每个体系&quot;要什么、什么时候要、要得多细&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>驱动体系</th>\n<th>要求主体</th>\n<th>关键规则</th>\n<th>时点/门槛</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国联邦分包</td>\n<td>联邦主承包商</td>\n<td>FAR 52.219-9 分包计划；eSRS 的 ISR / SSR 报表</td>\n<td>分包计划门槛 $900K（建筑 $2M）；ISR 每半年（截至 3/31、9/30）；SSR 年度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国州级公用事业</td>\n<td>加州 IOU 等 30+ 家（AT&amp;T、Comcast、PG&amp;E、SCE 等）</td>\n<td>GO 156：MBE/WBE/LGBTBE/DVBE 分类，经 Supplier Clearinghouse 验证</td>\n<td>年度；SB 255（2019-10）扩至 CCA、ESP 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟可持续尽职</td>\n<td>营业额 &gt; €450M 且员工 &gt; 1,000 的 EU 企业</td>\n<td>CSDDD 覆盖&quot;自身运营与<strong>全价值链</strong>&quot;</td>\n<td>分阶段：2027-07-26 首组（&gt; €15 亿 且 &gt; 6,000 员工），2028-07-26 次组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟可持续报告</td>\n<td>CSRD 范围内企业</td>\n<td>ESRS 供应链人权与价值链披露；Wave 2/3 经 &quot;Stop-the-Clock&quot; 推迟两年至 2028</td>\n<td>原 2024 起分阶段，现递延</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商业客户记分卡</td>\n<td>车企与 OEM</td>\n<td>按月上报（Ford / GM / Stellantis 对供应商）；CSRD / EcoVadis 披露</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（FAR 与 eSRS 见 <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/48/52.219-9\">FAR 52.219-9</a>；GO 156 见 <a href=\"https://www.cpuc.ca.gov/supplierdiversity\">CPUC</a>；CSDDD 见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corporate_Sustainability_Due_Diligence_Directive\">Wikipedia</a>；CSRD 递延见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Corporate_Sustainability_Reporting_Directive\">Wikipedia</a>。）</p>\n<p>两处容易踩的差异：其一，<strong>CSDDD 的&quot;价值链&quot;比 FAR 的&quot;紧邻下一层&quot;宽得多</strong>，同一份数据要能按不同深度切片输出；其二，联邦体系的<strong>分包计划有门槛</strong>，低于门槛的供应商没有法定义务，强行索要会污染参与率的分母。把这两条写进 <code>regulation_profile</code> 字段，报表引擎才能对同一份事实数据生成不同的合规视图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>tier-2 归因本质上是一次<strong>跨组织的数据合并</strong>：金额来自 prime 自报，证书来自第三方认定库，两者在归因中台按税号匹配。工程骨架只有四步——<strong>定层（只外扩一层）、过滤（剔除关联方、雇员关系、超属地金额）、回验（税号 + 公司名批量匹配认定库，三态放行）、计量（绝对额 + 占比 + 传导系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> + 参与率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PR</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>。反作弊要针对循环上报、过水与类别化上报分别设防，其中类别化上报无法自动验证，只能靠合同条款强制指名与指标可见化。</p>\n<p>最容易失败的地方不是算法，而是<strong>口径</strong>：同一份 tier-2 数据在美国联邦（紧邻一层、有 $900K 门槛）、加州 GO 156（年度、经 Supplier Clearinghouse 验证）、欧盟 CSDDD（全价值链、2027 起分阶段）三套体系下形态完全不同。把监管差异收敛到数据模型的一个 profile 字段，而非三套平行台账，是这套系统能否长期维护的关键。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多元化支出归因与二级（tier-2）传导计量","id":"多元化支出归因与二级-tier-2-传导计量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一级与二级的归因边界","id":"核心概念-一级与二级的归因边界"},{"level":2,"text":"归因规则：哪些金额可以计入，哪些必须剔除","id":"归因规则-哪些金额可以计入-哪些必须剔除"},{"level":2,"text":"校验链路：把二级供应商证书匹配回认定数据库","id":"校验链路-把二级供应商证书匹配回认定数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"计量指标与公式","id":"计量指标与公式"},{"level":2,"text":"反作弊：循环上报、过水与类别化上报","id":"反作弊-循环上报-过水与类别化上报"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境场景：谁在要求这份数据","id":"跨境场景-谁在要求这份数据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多元供应商认定与分类（WBE/MBE/WOSB/VOSB 证书与自证）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/diversity-spend-program/diverse-supplier-certification-classification"},"next":{"title":"多元化目标设定、激励与供应商准入/培育机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/diversity-spend-program/diversity-target-incentive-enrollment"}}